698">好在有错</span><span begin="53.698" end="54.502">过</span> <span begin="54.502" end="55.162">认</span><span begin="55.162" end="55.387">得</span><span begin="55.387" end="55.963">伤</span><span begin="55.963" end="56.675">心</span></p><p begin="56.880" end="1:01.805" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.880" end="58.092">任旅途多</span><span begin="58.092" end="58.412">花</span><span begin="58.412" end="59.142">意</span> <span begin="59.142" end="1:00.152">也牵着</span><span begin="1:00.152" end="1:00.718">荆棘</span><span begin="1:00.718" end="1:01.164">相</span><span begin="1:01.164" end="1:01.805">许</span></p><p begin="1:01.880" end="1:10.111" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.880" end="1:03.004">盼着破碎</span><span begin="1:03.004" end="1:04.001">长成</span><span begin="1:04.001" end="1:04.517">私</span><span begin="1:04.517" end="1:04.973">语</span> <span begin="1:05.493" end="1:06.263">暗里</span><span begin="1:06.263" end="1:06.840">轻</span><span begin="1:06.840" end="1:10.111">盈</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.000" end="1:42.680" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:16.000" end="1:24.409" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.000" end="1:17.169">谁愿</span><span begin="1:17.169" end="1:17.749">未风</span><span begin="1:17.749" end="1:18.200">先</span><span begin="1:18.200" end="1:19.536">雨</span> <span begin="1:20.537" end="1:21.834">谁在</span><span begin="1:21.834" end="1:22.274">雨</span><span begin="1:22.274" end="1:22.500">过</span><span begin="1:22.500" end="1:22.865">天</span><span begin="1:22.865" end="1:24.409">晴</span></p><p begin="1:25.436" end="1:32.417" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.436" end="1:26.362">我们</span><span begin="1:26.362" end="1:27.030">都</span><span begin="1:27.030" end="1:27.707">太</span><span begin="1:27.707" end="1:28.491">确</span><span begin="1:28.491" end="1:29.153">定</span> <span begin="1:29.532" end="1:30.761">那些捉摸</span><span begin="1:30.761" end="1:31.082">不</span><span begin="1:31.082" end="1:32.41